# ── Redaction rules for the published résumé PDF ──────────────────
# Copy to scripts/redactions.conf and fill in. That file is ignored
# by git: it holds the literal values, so it must never be committed.
#
# One rule per line.
#   text   <find>|<replace>     literal substitution in the document
#   drop   <find>               remove the run, and one bullet separator
#   mailto <address>            repoint every mail hyperlink here
#   deny   <string>             refuse to publish if it survives
#
# Lines beginning with # are ignored.

text    Example Town, ST 00000|Region, ST
drop    (000) 000-0000
mailto  you@example.com
deny    000-0000
deny    00000
